{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"510171","name":"薇斯纳【彩蛋】","desc":"薇斯纳【彩蛋】","icon_url":"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/30/50494840/2c8b57f640f7891cf0fb301f63599838_1048609334460924685.png","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"基本信息","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"npc_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"extra_attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e「冬契军」司令官、女皇的锋刃。\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色介绍\"}],\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/30/50494840/5bcf5ee7c692438cddade96a313eab90_8743963914633948306.png\",\"attr\":[{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"角色名\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e2月4日\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"生日\"},{\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e冬契军\u003c/p\u003e\"],\"key\":\"所属\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8151","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"角色展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/09/30/50494840/c42d2dc99efcf96809e78cc2dd54e4c9_5923957325930292530.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8155","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8174","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"默认标题\",\"image\":\"\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8175","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"prbpt7u2ztT1790535270781\",\"child_ids\":{\"prbpt7u2ztT1790535270781\":[]},\"contents\":{\"2qpdejz69fT1790571739547\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：你以权谋私。\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"41ctuljfnypT1790571738113\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：你监守自盗。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"fgy95l0gh4wT1790571740595\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：你你你…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"hf223sgk00uT1790571189619\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：咦？这地方好像是之前…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"itjqug3kj9mT1790571887516\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：欸！别胡说，你看我现在认真抄写联系方式的样子，既能让市民们安心，也能对票贩子们进行威慑。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：告诉他们，就算这么一点小事，我们冬契军也会追查到底，而且…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e冬契军：报告，旁边的小告示已经铲完了。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：好！还剩下一个街区就铲完了，大家再加把劲。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：等铲完了之后，我请大家去看演出，而且是最好的座位！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e冬契军们：喔一！\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"l3h5o32ldfT1790571485436\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：等等，但这里的联系方式…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"nyo4kpv9ylT1790571189123\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：发生什么了？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"prbpt7u2ztT1790535270781\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"q4o0v7201zT1790571599683\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：不得不精彩。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"q9zc88uo4eoT1790571336826\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：…嗯。\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：我根本不是啊！我也没有这么缺钱啊！这只是我们做宣传的手段，让大家千万别相信票贩子。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：想要买票，就去剧院门口排队，十个票贩子里九个拿钱就跑，千万不要白送冤枉钱…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qeh0etcstfT1790571230454\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：是之前票贩子留下联系方式的地方，对吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：咦？薇斯纳怎么知道的，当时沃雅妮莎改联系方式的时候，你好像也不在旁边啊…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：因为这就是我写的。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"qwxnytjb5yT1790571487396\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：是啊。我们的想法和亲爱的沃雅妮莎首席撞车了，但她说…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e沃雅妮莎：哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，好玩好玩，这样不是很有趣么？就像是抽奖一样，看看谁的运气最好，能抽到我的回信。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e沃雅妮莎：哎呀…笑得我肚子都痛了，过两天我也去和奥黛塔说说，让她也留个联系方式，这样子肯定更好玩。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：哈哈哈…至冬堡的人们，生活真精彩啊…\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"tslf90kiezT1790571274922\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：…冬契军的工资这么低吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e派蒙：…也、也没有低到这个地步吧？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：…你们为什么突然压低声音交头接耳？喂！你不会以为我监守自盗，以权谋私，悄悄给自己攒小金库，自己给自己撑保护伞吧！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙\u0026Lucy：......\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：我看起来像那种人？\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"ua5cez0c9q9T1790571617207\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：搞到现在，我都能认出沃雅妮莎的笔迹了，唉…等我把这些抄下来，这次的联系地址是这里啊…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e派蒙：你把它抄下来干什么？不是直接抹掉就好了吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：看你说的，沃雅妮莎小姐不是说，往这个地址寄信，她就会把钱和票一起退回来吗？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：平时沃雅妮莎小姐的演出票那么难买，这可都是白送的票，送谁不是送呢？就送我吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：哎呀，而且免费的票总是比买来的票用着更开心啊，嘿嘿嘿。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"v0io690o7dT1790571486131\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：不是已经被沃雅妮莎给…\",\"dialogue\":\"\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"v17549ymhlT1790571599167\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：有这么二位在…\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"},\"z9vl5wjb98fT1790571381477\":{\"option\":\"旅行者：真有这么多人上当吗？\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：反正我们那隔三差五就有人报案，说自己攒了好久的票钱打水漂了…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：唉，为了宣传这些我们真是用尽了办法，就连酒瓶上都印上了宣传语，但就是没人听啊。\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：所以我才想出了这一招，先是扫除了城里几乎所有的票贩子广告…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：再模仿票贩子联系方式的格式，写下新的留言，要是有人真的按照联系方式把钱寄过来的话…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：我们就派出一位冬契军，按照这个人留的联系方式把钱全数奉还，再附带着宣讲一下防骗的知识。\u003c/p\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8176","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"彩蛋一（曙光车站）","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"rich_base_info","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"key\":\"关键词\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e包 下错站\u003c/p\u003e\"]},{\"key\":\"备注\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e概率刷出；（可能需要使用\u003cspan class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"509399\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/08/12/105506159/ee456b1a822da51638d3b735b567c1ce_665542423116115553.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"「灰眸」\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509399/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"\u003e\u003ca href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/509399/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e「灰眸」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e召唤列车）\u003c/p\u003e\"]}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8177","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图展示","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"地图展示\",\"image\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2026/10/08/50494840/b31e14f184005d0589b4ddde785dce22_5031543701887490589.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8178","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情彩蛋对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"xo6kb5aozf9T1790535270792\",\"child_ids\":{\"xo6kb5aozf9T1790535270792\":[]},\"contents\":{\"xo6kb5aozf9T1790535270792\":{\"option\":\"\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003chtml\u003e\u003chead\u003e\u003c/head\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;7.0版本期间角色名为：？？？\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e：…这里是哪一站？哎哟，这一路睡得我头都晕了…难道真下错站了？\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：算了算了，错就错吧，坐了那么久的车，背都要断了，先活动活动再说…\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：呃…等等，我的包呢？不会还在车上吧…！\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e薇斯纳：我的钱和其他乱七八糟的全在包里啊！我不会要…从这里走回城里去吧——\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\",\"icon\":\"\"}}}],\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null}\n","style":""}],"id":"8179","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"七圣召唤对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"root_id\":\"el3xlh8nkjuT1790535270806\",\"child_ids\":{\"el3xlh8nkjuT1790535270806\":[]},\"contents\":{}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"8180","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"幻想真境剧诗对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactiv